{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026IJnCU1UD6T1792836460.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>強烈熱帶風暴薔琵為日本沖繩帶來暴雨。</p><p></p><p>沖繩縣靠近台灣的石垣島橫風橫雨，有樹木和路牌倒塌在路面。上午縣內電力供應中斷，約1.3萬戶受影響。石垣空港和川平等地過去48小時，錄得逾300毫米雨量，西表島降雨量更高達564毫米。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.TYPHOON-1700_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026jCccskRcjf1792836469.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>氣象廳預計，強降雨將持續到周二，提醒民眾防範巨浪、山泥傾瀉和低漥地區洪水等災害，避免不必要的外出。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.TYPHOON-1700_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026XOZnlXFSp01792836483.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>受風暴影響，全日空和日本航空周六共取消35班機，主要往返沖繩縣和鹿兒島偏遠島嶼的航班。航空公司表示，可能有更多航班取消和延誤，呼籲乘客留意最新資訊。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T11:22:52.323564+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":235,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T09:08:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T14:18:03.834433+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T11:18:10.704795+00:00","content_hash":"a809b3bf83582196ce88773b220d14c4f783d8f00eab580629b1e0a250d3e401","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-24T11:22:52.323564+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}